{"v":4,"catch":"《侍道》系列的衍生作品隆重問世！","desc":"《侍道外傳 刀神》是一個深入辭界（迷宮）討伐魑魅，暢遊深奧的攻防劍術的和風劍術動作RPG。\n為了拯救被債主帶走的打鐵鋪女兒，在夜晚前往孤松下進入辭界收集刀劍和素材，白天則待在山口的打鐵鋪賺錢，遊戲將以這樣的循環推進。\n登場的武器數量高達100種類以上，9種不同的戰鬥「架勢」，變換架勢享受截然不同的戰鬥風格。\n每當重新進入辭界時，地圖構造將會自動變換，無論挑戰幾次都仍能保有新鮮感。","publisher":"Spike Chunsoft","release":"2025-10-02","genres":["動作","角色扮演"],"players":"單機 1 人 · 網路 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","中文 (繁體)"],"pmax":2,"poff":1,"rating":"限制級","size":"Switch 2 2.2GB / Switch 2.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/fc343cc7ab2cf991e1a9330e3d7497029b1ccbd250b2af833c8e2392a54efa6f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/59402516fc08206ef7b7b00a9bb1071e17fbafc7741c5b64a67bd77c640a34e8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/26191dbbbf8fc99f9c1cea3ae3cb61d2613faa656e71a8cc03c1c0355a1281fe.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2c3a2481f695a66b498f1bc90ae9d61442c9bf9558911b0794b39792eb72adb3.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6c004d5844adeeb14063dba09390c2d20f0c2b809ed8ec4792b9726904891275.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5c51282d0676de4133ffb69b07accf7e81838fd38323849f53957770ee9948df.jpg"],"titleId":"0100f6a00e31e000","dlc":[{"id":"70050000061061","name":"名刀組合","img":"d425a94564e2aa2c02d164790289d570d7004dd36c37fa981ea22810b54cccab","date":"2025-12-04","mem":false},{"id":"70050000061063","name":"風來人套組","img":"d425a94564e2aa2c02d164790289d570d7004dd36c37fa981ea22810b54cccab","date":"2025-12-04","mem":false}]}